      "hash": "ccbb928ae3c5277f05e72785f37cfa18728aa1889cdb2a6dc5957925cc038e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "cf774d50a10c1ac4e6afce3bee83176f8820c4430a5aa33ad39146d37f1807bd",
      "text": "The AI Engineer Roadmap · 8 min read",
      "hash": "76b7645cc73b8619b3b16cd1c99c62f074f5c4ba6ed5747fd444122e4ea7486b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ab72a47db7b46e1cb3a7a0039123767f489072998c914446ca56c3b8d3140f88",
      "text": "How do you know if your AI application is hallucinating? How do you ensure it's outputting what you want it to? Evals are the answer.",
      "hash": "1f678e4c3ce147fc0ff2d8ffa1f7321ed744547d3d26009f89bd5ee66e54853d"
    },
    {
      "id": "425d36649077be98ccb5248f4cc38ecf4ddae3f9f3b458de5f61d76c31d45468",
